# AI appropriateness

- Owner Ops has no LLM runtime today; do not add one casually.
- Before recommending AI, complete the AI appropriateness gate (see AI_GOVERNANCE_STANDARD).
- Prefer autonomy A1–A3; A5 is forbidden without explicit architecture review and owner approval.
- Incomplete gate ⇒ PROVISIONAL / NOT READY.
- Do not implement the Blueprint generator (Phase 2 deferred).

See `owner-ops/docs/peacemakers-operating-system/AI_GOVERNANCE_STANDARD.md`.
